"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399208/de-verbannen-koningin.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789022592847 verschijningsdatum 19/04/2021 NUR 334 Fantasy 285 Fictie 15+ imprint Boekerij uitgever Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V. taal Nederlands","sha256":"649b7ff79b81035fbfcd2012d747448b87be6f78b2488192af84c45a97a404e4","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:41.180Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Holly Black"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399208/de-verbannen-koningin.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":928300729},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200024},"seq":3,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":977100012,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789463493666 verschijningsdatum 12/09/2022 NUR 285 Fictie 15+ imprint Blossom Books uitgever Blossom Books B.V. taal Nederlands","sha256":"49824d266fae9ac37c958853cdbc77d04217e17d2dd6b7fcac6e9e84f46a34d5","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:43.378Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Jennifer Lynn Barnes"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000579489_De_laatste_zet_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet1","bytes":270092,"sha256":"24dfc3fa84390130c5e72e522ac5c329e438ae14c10b0e7c4f1ac3ea54e385ad","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:31.452Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000579489_De_laatste_zet_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200024,"bound_title":"De laatste zet","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789463493666","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":924300308},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100012,"language":"nl"},"seq":4,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Avery Grambs hoeft nog maar enkele weken in Hawthorne House te blijven voordat de erfenis van Tobias Hawthorne definitief van haar is. Een onbekend meisje dat om hulp vraagt, verstoort die laatste fase. Haar komst brengt nieuwe geheimen naar boven en maakt duidelijk dat het familieverleden nog niet is ontrafeld. Met de Hawthorne-broers probeert Avery te begrijpen wie achter een gevaarlijk laatste spel zit.","work_id":977100012,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789463493666 verschijningsdatum 12/09/2022 NUR 285 Fictie 15+ imprint Blossom Books uitgever Blossom Books B.V. taal Nederlands","sha256":"49824d266fae9ac37c958853cdbc77d04217e17d2dd6b7fcac6e9e84f46a34d5","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:43.378Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Jennifer Lynn Barnes"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":924300308},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200026},"seq":5,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":977100013,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1172768/de-obeliskpoort.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789024580453 verschijningsdatum 04/04/2019 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Luitingh Sijthoff Fantasy uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sha256":"0c9e5743c458cedd05b6a872c4aa1ffc23005c9987f0be26ba174d1707cc5daa","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:45.529Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"N.K. Jemisin"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000287030_De_Gebroken_Aarde_2_-_De_Obeliskpoort_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet2","bytes":1319920,"sha256":"939397e01e917d1db4c8b68576ca8a7ae641000d89c6766d4b95f57cd157e4e6","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:32.790Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000287030_De_Gebroken_Aarde_2_-_De_Obeliskpoort_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200026,"bound_title":"De Obeliskpoort","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789024580453","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1172768/de-obeliskpoort.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":921300024},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100013,"language":"nl"},"seq":6,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Essun heeft tijdens het nieuwe Seizoen een schuilplaats gevonden, maar haar dochter is nog steeds verdwenen. Een ontmoeting met Alabaster Tienring stelt haar voor een verzoek dat verder reikt dan hun eigen overleving. Ondertussen groeit haar dochter elders in kracht. Hun afzonderlijke keuzes raken verbonden met de raadselachtige obelisken en met de toekomst van de Stilte, terwijl asregens en duisternis het bestaan steeds moeilijker maken.","work_id":977100013,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1172768/de-obeliskpoort.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789024580453 verschijningsdatum 04/04/2019 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Luitingh Sijthoff Fantasy uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sha256":"0c9e5743c458cedd05b6a872c4aa1ffc23005c9987f0be26ba174d1707cc5daa","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:45.529Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"N.K. Jemisin"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1172768/de-obeliskpoort.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":921300024},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200028},"seq":7,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":977100014,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463834/het-rad-des-tijds-7-een-kroon-van-zwaarden-pod.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789024555383 verschijningsdatum 13/07/2006 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Luitingh uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sha256":"f1dc64b1f26cd5ad1f4d51c89901caddf036deeed4bfd688042d4310821b7f52","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:03.088Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Robert Jordan"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000214403_Een_kroon_van_zwaarden_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet2","bytes":96912,"sha256":"e036970ec1d624995f58d116582f79c2096ff6fb25be6f52722bce49ceb46c34","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:34.204Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000214403_Een_kroon_van_zwaarden_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200028,"bound_title":"Een kroon van zwaarden","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789024555383","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463834/het-rad-des-tijds-7-een-kroon-van-zwaarden-pod.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":8800015},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100014,"language":"nl"},"seq":8,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Terwijl de Laatste Slag dichterbij komt, raken de tegenstanders van de Duistere steeds verder over verschillende gebieden verspreid. Rhand Altor breidt zijn macht uit en Egwene leidt haar aanhangers naar het noorden. Elders zoeken Elayne, Aviendha, Nynaeve en Mart naar de Schaal der Winden. Hun ondernemingen spelen zich af tegenover een vijand die oude dienaren in nieuwe gedaanten opnieuw inzet en daarmee herkenning en vertrouwen bemoeilijkt.","work_id":977100014,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463834/het-rad-des-tijds-7-een-kroon-van-zwaarden-pod.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789024555383 verschijningsdatum 13/07/2006 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Luitingh uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sha256":"f1dc64b1f26cd5ad1f4d51c89901caddf036deeed4bfd688042d4310821b7f52","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:03.088Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Robert Jordan"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463834/het-rad-des-tijds-7-een-kroon-van-zwaarden-pod.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":8800015},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200029},"seq":9,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":977100015,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/180637/winterberg.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789400517905 verschijningsdatum 15/10/2024 NUR 332 Thriller imprint A.W. Bruna Uitgevers uitgever Bruna Uitgevers B.V., A.W. taal Nederlands","sha256":"610543b106fedb9e1e501d748cd6ef3adbffae254e7b6a1ca9cdbfd9d8684498","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:07.437Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Suzanne Vermeer"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000665485_Winterberg_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet2","bytes":549830,"sha256":"ef037ec2f724013b75e875dfe349d2a4ec3c283e12bc4f8e9377e0972547ab0b","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:35.498Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000665485_Winterberg_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200029,"bound_title":"Winterberg","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789400517905","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/180637/winterberg.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"nld","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":91021002},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100015,"language":"nl"},"seq":10,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Sophie reist met haar nichten naar Winterberg om het testament van hun overleden tante Eva te horen. De voorwaarden bij de erfenis veroorzaken ruzie binnen de familie. Wanneer Isa na een conflict verdwijnt, gaat Sophie naar haar op zoek en vindt haar dood terug. Vervolgens wordt Sophies echtgenoot Daan als verdachte aangehouden. Zijn ontkenning botst met belastend bewijs, waardoor Sophie ook haar eigen zekerheden moet onderzoeken.","work_id":977100015,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/180637/winterberg.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789400517905 verschijningsdatum 15/10/2024 NUR 332 Thriller imprint A.W. Bruna Uitgevers uitgever Bruna Uitgevers B.V., A.W. taal Nederlands","sha256":"610543b106fedb9e1e501d748cd6ef3adbffae254e7b6a1ca9cdbfd9d8684498","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:07.437Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Suzanne Vermeer"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/180637/winterberg.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":91021002},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200030},"seq":11,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"paperback","work_id":977100016,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1185010/de-eilanden.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789400517813 verschijningsdatum 18/06/2024 NUR 332 Thriller imprint A.W. Bruna Uitgevers uitgever Bruna Uitgevers B.V., A.W. taal Nederlands","sha256":"4d10e968e0d3a291626c5298a1e65b5ef24afa805f3c65e838d6c2a964444ea2","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:09.704Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Suzanne Vermeer"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000698261_De_eilanden_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet2","bytes":583095,"sha256":"357876eb6ea1f30ead763314a0b1c24085d345c4be7fb3685628345c602e137f","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:36.850Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000698261_De_eilanden_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200030,"bound_title":"De eilanden","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789400517813","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1185010/de-eilanden.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"nld","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":91021002},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100016,"language":"nl"},"seq":12,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Deze bundel verzamelt zeven korte verhalen die zich op verschillende eilanden afspelen, onder meer Ibiza, Bali, Gran Canaria en Curaçao. Zeven vrouwen staan centraal in vertellingen waarin een eilandbestemming niet vanzelfsprekend rust of veiligheid biedt. Achter de vakantiesfeer schuilen geheimen en dreiging. Het boek brengt afzonderlijke verhalen samen; het is geen extra deel van één doorlopend verhaal. Ook een winnende inzending uit een vakantiethrillerwedstrijd is opgenomen.","work_id":977100016,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1185010/de-eilanden.html","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789400517813 verschijningsdatum 18/06/2024 NUR 332 Thriller imprint A.W. Bruna Uitgevers uitgever Bruna Uitgevers B.V., A.W. taal Nederlands","sha256":"4d10e968e0d3a291626c5298a1e65b5ef24afa805f3c65e838d6c2a964444ea2","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:09.704Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Suzanne Vermeer"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1185010/de-eilanden.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":91021002},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":977200032},"seq":13,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":977100017,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2144054/fourth-wing-titel-volgt-niet-boek-4.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789020564563 verschijningsdatum 29/09/2026 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Z&K uitgever VBK Media taal Nederlands","sha256":"95605e63d7fb3e51b75ffe445454a045f5d4dae3dcf7169887b5a4b52e017dab","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:11.820Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Rebecca Yarros"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000799720_Threshing_day_0_0.jpg","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet2","bytes":902070,"sha256":"e476c191b7e09d393db2ea32502c24d42613708d30072f7cb87bc7cf06b0cecb","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:38.214Z"}],"cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000799720_Threshing_day_0_0.jpg","edition_id":977200032,"bound_title":"Threshing day","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789020564563","evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2144054/fourth-wing-titel-volgt-niet-boek-4.html","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"nld","card_cover_url":null,"bound_author_id":924300152},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":977100017,"language":"nl"},"seq":14,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Dertien verhalen keren terug naar de Verkoring, de beproeving waarin eerstejaars van Basgiath een band met een draak proberen te vormen. Onder anderen Xaden, Rhiannon en Dain beleven de competitie vanuit hun eigen positie. Rivaliteit en gevaar maken iedere stap onzeker, maar uiteindelijk kiest de draak. Deze geïllustreerde companion bij de Empyrean-reeks belicht bekende personages en hun draken, zonder als een nieuw hoofddeel van de reeks te worden voorgesteld.","work_id":977100017,"evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2144054/fourth-wing-titel-volgt-niet-boek-4.html","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789020564563 verschijningsdatum 29/09/2026 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Z&K uitgever VBK Media taal Nederlands","sha256":"95605e63d7fb3e51b75ffe445454a045f5d4dae3dcf7169887b5a4b52e017dab","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:11.820Z","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge.","sourceAuthors":"Rebecca Yarros"}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/2144054/fourth-wing-titel-volgt-niet-boek-4.html","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00+00:00","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch