gende oorlog haar plannen en gevoelens verder onder druk zet.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399208/de-verbannen-koningin.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1399208/de-verbannen-koningin.html","sha256":"649b7ff79b81035fbfcd2012d747448b87be6f78b2488192af84c45a97a404e4","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:41.180Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789022592847 verschijningsdatum 19/04/2021 NUR 334 Fantasy 285 Fictie 15+ imprint Boekerij uitgever Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V. taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Holly Black","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789463493666","key":{"edition_id":977200024},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":977200024,"work_id":977100012,"bound_author_id":924300308,"bound_title":"De laatste zet","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789463493666","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000579489_De_laatste_zet_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","sha256":"49824d266fae9ac37c958853cdbc77d04217e17d2dd6b7fcac6e9e84f46a34d5","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:43.378Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789463493666 verschijningsdatum 12/09/2022 NUR 285 Fictie 15+ imprint Blossom Books uitgever Blossom Books B.V. taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Jennifer Lynn Barnes","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000579489_De_laatste_zet_0_0.jpg","sha256":"24dfc3fa84390130c5e72e522ac5c329e438ae14c10b0e7c4f1ac3ea54e385ad","bytes":270092,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:31.452Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet1"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2213","key":{"work_id":977100012,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100012,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300308,"text":"Avery Grambs hoeft nog maar enkele weken in Hawthorne House te blijven voordat de erfenis van Tobias Hawthorne definitief van haar is. Een onbekend meisje dat om hulp vraagt, verstoort die laatste fase. Haar komst brengt nieuwe geheimen naar boven en maakt duidelijk dat het familieverleden nog niet is ontrafeld. Met de Hawthorne-broers probeert Avery te begrijpen wie achter een gevaarlijk laatste spel zit.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","sha256":"49824d266fae9ac37c958853cdbc77d04217e17d2dd6b7fcac6e9e84f46a34d5","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:43.378Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789463493666 verschijningsdatum 12/09/2022 NUR 285 Fictie 15+ imprint Blossom Books uitgever Blossom Books B.V. taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Jennifer Lynn Barnes","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024580453","key":{"edition_id":977200026},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":977200026,"work_id":977100013,"bound_author_id":921300024,"bound_title":"De Obeliskpoort","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789024580453","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000287030_De_Gebroken_Aarde_2_-_De_Obeliskpoort_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1172768/de-obeliskpoort.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1172768/de-obeliskpoort.html","sha256":"0c9e5743c458cedd05b6a872c4aa1ffc23005c9987f0be26ba174d1707cc5daa","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:45.529Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789024580453 verschijningsdatum 04/04/2019 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Luitingh Sijthoff Fantasy uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"N.K. Jemisin","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000287030_De_Gebroken_Aarde_2_-_De_Obeliskpoort_0_0.jpg","sha256":"939397e01e917d1db4c8b68576ca8a7ae641000d89c6766d4b95f57cd157e4e6","bytes":1319920,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:32.790Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet2"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2217","key":{"work_id":977100013,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100013,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":921300024,"text":"Essun heeft tijdens het nieuwe Seizoen een schuilplaats gevonden, maar haar dochter is nog steeds verdwenen. Een ontmoeting met Alabaster Tienring stelt haar voor een verzoek dat verder reikt dan hun eigen overleving. Ondertussen groeit haar dochter elders in kracht. Hun afzonderlijke keuzes raken verbonden met de raadselachtige obelisken en met de toekomst van de Stilte, terwijl asregens en duisternis het bestaan steeds moeilijker maken.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1172768/de-obeliskpoort.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1172768/de-obeliskpoort.html","sha256":"0c9e5743c458cedd05b6a872c4aa1ffc23005c9987f0be26ba174d1707cc5daa","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:45.529Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789024580453 verschijningsdatum 04/04/2019 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Luitingh Sijthoff Fantasy uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"N.K. Jemisin","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024555383","key":{"edition_id":977200028},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":977200028,"work_id":977100014,"bound_author_id":8800015,"bound_title":"Een kroon van zwaarden","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789024555383","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000214403_Een_kroon_van_zwaarden_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463834/het-rad-des-tijds-7-een-kroon-van-zwaarden-pod.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463834/het-rad-des-tijds-7-een-kroon-van-zwaarden-pod.html","sha256":"f1dc64b1f26cd5ad1f4d51c89901caddf036deeed4bfd688042d4310821b7f52","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:03.088Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789024555383 verschijningsdatum 13/07/2006 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Luitingh uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Robert Jordan","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000214403_Een_kroon_van_zwaarden_0_0.jpg","sha256":"e036970ec1d624995f58d116582f79c2096ff6fb25be6f52722bce49ceb46c34","bytes":96912,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:34.204Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet2"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2539","key":{"work_id":977100014,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100014,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":8800015,"text":"Terwijl de Laatste Slag dichterbij komt, raken de tegenstanders van de Duistere steeds verder over verschillende gebieden verspreid. Rhand Altor breidt zijn macht uit en Egwene leidt haar aanhangers naar het noorden. Elders zoeken Elayne, Aviendha, Nynaeve en Mart naar de Schaal der Winden. Hun ondernemingen spelen zich af tegenover een vijand die oude dienaren in nieuwe gedaanten opnieuw inzet en daarmee herkenning en vertrouwen bemoeilijkt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463834/het-rad-des-tijds-7-een-kroon-van-zwaarden-pod.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1463834/het-rad-des-tijds-7-een-kroon-van-zwaarden-pod.html","sha256":"f1dc64b1f26cd5ad1f4d51c89901caddf036deeed4bfd688042d4310821b7f52","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:59:03.088Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789024555383 verschijningsdatum 13/07/2006 NUR 334 Fantasy imprint Luitingh uitgever Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Robert Jordan","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789400517905","key":{"edition_id":977200029},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":977200029,"work_id":977100015,"bound_author_id":91021002,"bound_title":"Winterberg","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789400517905","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000665485_Winterberg_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":